  "description": "The AR Invoice Agent lets you quickly and securely get essential information about your accounts receivable transactions using a simple conversational interface. You can ask the agent about customers, transaction dates, amounts, Invoice status, and more—all within your familiar Oracle Fusion environment. If the agent can’t answer your question directly, it will provide a secure link so you can drill down into the full transaction details. Your data privacy and access rights are always preserved, as the agent works seamlessly with your existing security settings.",
